  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH File Review",
      "text": "**Review every file an agent just changed—without leaving DeepSeek Harness Web.**\n\n[](package.json)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-file-review)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-file-review)\n[](https://github.com/left0ver/dsh-file-review)\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://www.dsh.so/artifact/dsh-file-review/)\n\nEnglish · [简体中文](README.zh.md)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "How to use",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <strong>💬 Chat &nbsp;→&nbsp; ✨ Generate &nbsp;→&nbsp; 📄 Click a changed file &nbsp;→&nbsp; 🔍 Review</strong>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "1. This plugin supports standard, PTC, and Creator modes, but **does not currently support Minimal mode**.\n2. Review every file the agent just changed, shown in the `Diff` panel.\n3. Enable DSH's `apply_patch` tool by default when installed. Review text file creation, editing, deletion, and moves, with undo and reapply support.\n   > Use `apply_patch` to review file deletions and moves; the plugin captures the original content and file permissions before deletion.\n4. Add comments to changed lines and ask the agent to continue making updates based on the feedback, or ask questions about the changes.\n5. Automatically wrap long text while reviewing. Enable it under Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration → File review; it is disabled by default.\n6. Multilingual support — both English and Chinese are supported."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "The badge above shows the DSH CLI version this release was tested against. This release supports `0.2.2-rc.1` through the `0.2.2` release and requires Node.js 24.9 or later. The exact DSH range is `engines.dsh` in [package.json](package.json), with the same range declared in `peerDependencies`.\n\nOutside that range, DSH refuses to load the plugin. To run it anyway at your own risk, grant an exemption for the exact versions involved:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web allow-version dsh-file-review@<plugin-version> --dsh-version <dsh-version> --accept-risk\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "0. Add dsh-file-review to pnpm's minimum release age allowlist",
      "text": "Open `~/.dsh/profiles/web/pnpm-workspace.yaml` and add:\n\n```yaml\nminimumReleaseAgeExclude:\n  - dsh-file-review\n```\n\nRecent versions of `pnpm` enforce a minimum release age, so newly published packages are not installed until that waiting period has passed. To install the latest versions, add `dsh-file-review` to the exclusion list."
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Install this plugin",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-file-review\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Start DSH Web",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from source",
      "text": "```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/left0ver/dsh-file-review.git\ncd dsh-file-review\npnpm install\npnpm run build"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from GitHub repository",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:left0ver/dsh-file-review\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Update the plugin",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-file-review\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall the plugin",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-file-review\n```"
    },
